{"3636100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHEEP", "steam_appid": 3636100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHEEP </strong>is a<strong> challenging, surreal first-person herding adventure</strong> that takes you through pastures, mountains, space, and pocket dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/c4e681544ba5e7c9e5e505ed25f17966.poster.avif?t=1786407133\" width=800 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/c4e681544ba5e7c9e5e505ed25f17966.webm?t=1786407133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/c4e681544ba5e7c9e5e505ed25f17966.mp4?t=1786407133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐑 Lead Your Flock – Control Woolsworth to guide your flock. Use clever movement and positioning to solve puzzles and traverse treacherous terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 Gain Magic Abilities - Find hidden crystals to unlock powerful new moves and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Challenging encounters - Fast-paced fights that reward sharp reflexes and clever use of your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Explore the Surreal - From grassy hills to foggy chasms, lava caverns, and starry arenas. Each level is a strange new world with its own secrets and threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 Uncover Hidden Realms - Secret access points transport you to six optional levels full of traps, puzzles, and battles, leading to a chaotic and challenging finale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**All side levels include a built in timer and best time bulletin board <strong>FOR SPEEDRUNNERS!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Original Soundtrack - From relaxed ambiance to high energy electronic, this score will carry you through each strange new world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/74ba44f9e805dfd06963aabe0ca7578f.poster.avif?t=1786407133\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/74ba44f9e805dfd06963aabe0ca7578f.webm?t=1786407133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/74ba44f9e805dfd06963aabe0ca7578f.mp4?t=1786407133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/b71210b2f2fcadfeae8b73094e7f7649.poster.avif?t=1786407133\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/b71210b2f2fcadfeae8b73094e7f7649.webm?t=1786407133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/b71210b2f2fcadfeae8b73094e7f7649.mp4?t=1786407133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/f3faca0baf7ae80e8fa63887d479d6e9.poster.avif?t=1786407133\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/f3faca0baf7ae80e8fa63887d479d6e9.webm?t=1786407133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636100/extras/f3faca0baf7ae80e8fa63887d479d6e9.mp4?t=1786407133\" type=\"video/mp4\"><